        "Description": "A client has hired us to take out a group of pretenders working under the Kronstadt family. These men have been privately working on a dangerous project as a part of the rising orginisation known as the &quot;The Legitimate Businessman&apos;s Social Club&quot;.\r\rIf their project advances past it&apos;s infancy stages it could risk the sanctity of the Kronstadt empire. Only you can topple these rising renegades and cripple their newfound orginisation.\r\rGood Luck  47.",
